-12-05T21:52:12Z","updated_at":"2015-12-07T21:26:15Z","closed_at":"2015-12-07T21:26:15Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I installed the 0.1.2 release from the deb over the previously installed 0.1.2rc2, and got this:\n\n```\n$ sudo dpkg -i bazel_0.1.2-linux-x86_64.deb \n[sudo] password for kamal: \ndpkg: warning: downgrading bazel from 0.1.2rc2 to 0.1.2\n(Reading database ... 277052 files and directories currently installed.)\nPreparing to unpack bazel_0.1.2-linux-x86_64.deb ...\nUnpacking bazel (0.1.2) over (0.1.2rc2) ...\nSetting up bazel (0.1.2) ...\n```\n\nThe downgrade warning could be avoided by using a `~` in the version as these compare less than any string including the empty string.\n\n```\n$ perl -le 'use Dpkg::Version; print join \"\\n\", sort version_compare qw(0.1.2 0.1.2rc2 0.1.2-rc2 0.1.2~rc2)'\n0.1.2~rc2\n0.1.2\n0.1.2-rc2\n0.1.2rc2\n```\n\nMore info on Debian version number comparison: https://www.debian.org/doc/debian-policy/ch-controlfields.html#s-f-Version\n","closed_by":{"login":"damienmg","id":3721087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjEwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3721087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg","html_url":"https://github.com/damienmg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/